    "created_at": "2022-03-24T07:21:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-03-24T07:21:45Z",
    "body": "Allowing `object` for interactive SVG for now seems reasonable. If `iframe` gets an opt-in to autosizing that works for SVG, we can recommend using `iframe`, but that's not the case right now.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
