    "created_at": "2022-06-16T14:25:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-06-16T14:25:41Z",
    "body": "So note that both embed *and* object have autosizing to interactive SVG contents (whereas iframe does not): http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=10403 . This makes the choice of what to deprecate a bit arbitrary.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/7939 is appealing, if we could just remove that capability...",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
